        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Although, we believe that our electric powertrain systems are more efficient and powerful than current offerings on the market, our competitors, including Torqeedo, may have greater resources than we do and OEMs may find their designs or price to be more attractive than ours.",
        "start_character": 43214,
        "end_character": 43490
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-25-116945",
